The first fourteen files come from commit
c368b8884476f5588b64e6be14c80be25327b6ac; HeatKernelHolder and ZHolder come
from commit 27c7f7c21f2f93923054357cf740c1db521093d5. Their declarations
use subject namespaces under LatticeProb, and their imports and documentation
are adapted to this library. ZHolder takes the heat kernel and its explicit
formula as parameters.

The modules under LatticeProb/Graph/CopiedGraph/ adapt copied-graph definitions
and elementary walk, tree and forest proofs from Ahmed Bou-Rabee's
https://github.com/nitromannitol/finite-avalanche,
commit 6696f7cde7e1676c0f34095f2378dc8a39f1dbc1.
They retain original edge-copy IDs, use the LatticeProb namespace and
universe-polymorphic carriers, and add tree-cut counting, path divergence and
Poisson-potential proofs. LatticeProb/Graph/CopiedGraph/EXTRACTION.json records
the original file hashes and declaration adaptations. No dependency on that
repository is included.

Files not named above are original to this repository.

LatticeProb/Graph/CopiedGraph/RootedForestCounting.lean adapts the finite
conditional-sum decomposition in Mathlib.Data.Fintype.BigOperators
(Fintype.prod_dite) to additive sums. Mathlib is Apache-2.0 licensed; the
source revision is 81a5d257c8e410db227a6665ed08f64fea08e997. This proof keeps
Mathlib's copyright attribution in its source. The remaining new all-minors,
incidence, root-matching and Cauchy–Binet proofs are original to this library.
